{"id":68234,"date":"2025-10-01T06:55:35","date_gmt":"2025-10-01T05:55:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=68234"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:29:44","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:29:44","slug":"trail-elvas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-elvas\/","title":{"rendered":"VIII Trail Elvas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">VIII Trail Elvas 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>VIII Trail Elvas 2026<\/strong> (Trail de Elvas \u2013 Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial) realiza-se no dia <strong>6 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partidas a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong> no Museu Militar de Elvas, em <strong>Elvas, Portalegre<\/strong>. A emblem\u00e1tica competi\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva percorre os trilhos hist\u00f3ricos e as fortifica\u00e7\u00f5es militares de Elvas, cidade classificada como Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial pela UNESCO.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa integra provas competitivas nas dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>Trail Longo (30 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Sprint (18 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Mini Trail (12 km)<\/strong>, todas a pontuar para os circuitos distritais da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Distrito de Portalegre (AADP), para al\u00e9m de uma <strong>Caminhada pedestre de 10 km<\/strong>. Os atletas contam com postos de abastecimento l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica de emerg\u00eancia e medalha exclusiva de finalista.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva IALBAX<\/strong>, com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o ativa do Munic\u00edpio de Elvas e do Museu Militar de Elvas, promovendo a pr\u00e1tica desportiva e a valoriza\u00e7\u00e3o cultural e patrimonial da regi\u00e3o.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-s