s: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada &#8211; 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 6 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:05<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o \u00danico (At\u00e9 27\/11\/2026):<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o VIII Trail Elvas 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no dia 6 de Dezembro de 2026 (Domingo) em Elvas, Portalegre, com secretariado e partidas concentrados no Museu Militar de Elvas a partir das 09:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa inclui o Trail Longo de 30 km (partida \u00e0s 09:00), o Trail Sprint de 18 km (09:30), o Mini Trail de 12 km (10:00) e a Caminhada de 10 km (10:05).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas na plataforma Trilho Perdido at\u00e9 27 de Novembro de 2026, com valores desde 10,00 \u20ac na Caminhada, 12,00 \u20ac no Mini Trail, 15,00 \u20ac no Trail Sprint e 17,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo durante a primeira fase.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">As provas pontuam para algum campeonato oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, as tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias de Trail integram os Circuitos Distritais de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Distrito de Portalegre (AADP).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial do participante?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito ao dorsal oficial, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos de percurso e meta, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica e medalha exclusiva de participa\u00e7\u00e3o a todos os que conclu\u00edrem o percurso.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento completo em formato PDF e todos os detalhes t\u00e9cnicos est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis diretamente na hiperliga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial indicada no portal.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"VIII Trail Elvas 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-06\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Elvas, Portalegre\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Elvas\", \"addressRegion\": \"Portalegre\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o VIII Trail Elvas 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no dia 6 de Dezembro de 2026 (Domingo) em Elvas, Portalegre, com secretariado e partidas concentrados no Museu Militar de Elvas a partir das 09:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e hor\u00e1rios de partida das provas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa inclui o Trail Longo de 30 km (partida \u00e0s 09:00), o Trail Sprint de 18 km (09:30), o Mini Trail de 12 km (10:00) e a Caminhada de 10 km (10:05).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os prazos e valores de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas na plataforma Trilho Perdido at\u00e9 27 de Novembro de 2026, com valores desde 10,00 \u20ac na Caminhada, 12,00 \u20ac no Mini Trail, 15,00 \u20ac no Trail Sprint e 17,00 \u20ac no Trail Longo durante a primeira fase.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"As provas pontuam para algum campeonato oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, as tr\u00eas dist\u00e2ncias de Trail integram os Circuitos Distritais de Trail da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo do Distrito de Portalegre (AADP).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial do participante?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o d\u00e1 direito ao dorsal oficial, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos de percurso e meta, assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica e medalha exclusiva de participa\u00e7\u00e3o a todos os que conclu\u00edrem o percurso.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O regulamento completo em formato PDF e todos os detalhes t\u00e9cnicos est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis diretamente na hiperliga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial indicada no portal.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68356,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,40,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-68234","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-elvas-portalegre","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portalegre","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-trail-elvas-1.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68234","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=68234"}],"version-history":[{"count":4,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/68234\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":68689,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\